        <mxCell id="note" value="Verified locally (2026-08-12, no API key): _detect_language() correctly separates ko/en/zh single-language input; mixed-language short phrases can skew English due to raw character-count weighting (e.g. &quot;앵무새 feather plucking 증상&quot; -&gt; English) -- noted as a real edge case, not a claimed bug fix. DeepSeek call verified to fail gracefully (returns None) when DEEPSEEK_API_KEY is unset. Real DeepSeek/GPT-4o Vision responses were NOT captured live -- billing key constraint (see Key Results)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1">
