        <mxCell id="loop" value="Shared data, parallel consumers (verified in code, not a direct call): bhi_service.calculate_bhi() computes the 0-100 composite score for the BHI screen. Separately, ai_service._build_rag_context(pet_id) queries the SAME 30-day weight/food/water tables and injects the raw records as text into the AI Encyclopedia system prompt (Axis 2) alongside RAG knowledge (Axis 1). The Flutter-built pet_profile_context field carries only static profile info (name/breed/age/gender) -- it does NOT carry the BHI score. So the AI chat sees the bird's raw recent trend, not the computed 0-100 number." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1">
